        A Dell OptiPlex 5050 (i7-7700, 32 GB) running Debian and about twenty containers. It
        started as a 2009 office PC. <a href="/work/homelab/">The full story is in Work.</a>
      </p>

      <h3 class="h3">The gear</h3>
      <p class="sub">Click anything in the rack, or pick it from the list.</p>
      <div class="rig-grid">
        <figure class="rack-fig">
          <svg class="rack" viewBox="0 0 440 520" role="group" aria-label="The home server gear, drawn as a rack, with clickable devices">
            <rect x="20" y="10" width="400" height="500" rx="12" class="r-frame" />
            <rect x="34" y="22" width="14" height="476" rx="2" class="r-rail" />
            <rect x="392" y="22" width="14" height="476" rx="2" class="r-rail" />
            {Array.from({ length: 24 }, (_, i) => (
              <g class="r-holes">
                <rect x="38" y={30 + i * 19.6} width="6" height="6" rx="1" />
                <rect x="396" y={30 + i * 19.6} width="6" height="6" rx="1" />
